flowchart LR
  S[Source owner\nminimum versioned facts] --> Q[Durable transport]
  Q --> I[Query-owner Inbox\nidempotency + tenant]
  I --> P[Versioned owned projection]
  P --> API[Eventually consistent query/API]
  P --> R[Reconciliation + drift detection]
  R -->|Mismatch| B[Stop consumption\nretain source + checkpoint]
  B --> F[Fix / compatible schema]
  F --> X[Bootstrap or full rebuild]
  X --> C[Incremental catch-up]
  C --> R
  P -. forbidden .-> J[Cross-DbContext/table fallback]
